 and M.E. Gershwin. <year>1998</year>. Monoclonal antibodies to mitochondrial E2 components define autoepitopes in primary biliary cirrhosis. <source>J. Immunol.</source> <volume>161</volume>:<fpage>5157</fpage>&#x02013;5163.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9820485</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>